# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] barrel.js is dynamically imported by bridge.js but also statically imported by d.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] d.js is dynamically imported by main.js but also statically imported by main.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

